{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"decode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"input","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UnicodeO4UTF8O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs5UInt8V7ElementRtzlF1IL_xmfp","text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UnicodeDecodingResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:s21UnicodeDecodingResultO","text":"UnicodeDecodingResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:St","text":"IteratorProtocol","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:St7ElementQa","text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt8","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5UInt8V","text":"UInt8","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An iterator of code units to be decoded. ","type":"text"},{"code":"input","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same iterator instance in repeated calls to this method. Do not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"advance the iterator or any copies of the iterator outside this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"input"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"UnicodeDecodingResult","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instance, representing the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unicode scalar, an indication of an error, or an indication that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"UTF sequence has been fully decoded."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To decode a code unit sequence completely, call this method repeatedly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until it returns "},{"code":"UnicodeDecodingResult.emptyInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Checking that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iterator was exhausted is not sufficient, because the decoder can store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffered data from the input iterator."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because of buffering, it is impossible to find the corresponding position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the iterator for a given returned "},{"code":"Unicode.Scalar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or an error."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example decodes the UTF-8 encoded bytes of a string into an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array of "},{"code":"Unicode.Scalar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instances. This is a demonstration only—if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you need the Unicode scalar representation of a string, use its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"unicodeScalars","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let str = \"✨Unicode✨\"","print(Array(str.utf8))","\/\/ Prints \"[226, 156, 168, 85, 110, 105, 99, 111, 100, 101, 226, 156, 168]\"","","var bytesIterator = str.utf8.makeIterator()","var scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = []","var utf8Decoder = UTF8()","Decode: while true {","    switch utf8Decoder.decode(&bytesIterator) {","    case .scalarValue(let v): scalars.append(v)","    case .emptyInput: break Decode","    case .error:","        print(\"Decoding error\")","        break Decode","    }","}","print(scalars)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"\\u{2728}\", \"U\", \"n\", \"i\", \"c\", \"o\", \"d\", \"e\", \"\\u{2728}\"]\""]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/unicode\/utf8\/decode(_:)-swift.method"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF8"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF8\/decode(_:)-swift.method","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","deprec